                      (    forth6809.asm):06825                                      ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):06826                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):06827                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):06828                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06829                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):06830                                      ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
                      (    forth6809.asm):06831                                      ; happens to equal PADMINSIZE numerically
                      (    forth6809.asm):06832                                      ; in this implementation (PADOFFSET EQU
                      (    forth6809.asm):06833                                      ; PADMINSIZE), but /PAD is answered with
                      (    forth6809.asm):06834                                      ; the conceptually correct constant, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):06835                                      ; the coincidentally-equal one.
FDC5 FE1200070000     (    forth6809.asm):06836                  FDB   EN9,EN9L,0    ; NEW: FLOORED - previously the one item
                      (    forth6809.asm):06837                                      ; in this area explicitly left open
                      (    forth6809.asm):06838                                      ; pending its own investigation (unlike
                      (    forth6809.asm):06839                                      ; WORDLISTS, this is a CORE query, not
                      (    forth6809.asm):06840                                      ; tied to an unimplemented optional word
                      (    forth6809.asm):06841                                      ; set, so "false by omission" wasn't the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06842                                      ; right default). Investigated by tracing
                      (    forth6809.asm):06843                                      ; DIVCOMMON (shared by /, MOD, /MOD)
                      (    forth6809.asm):06844                                      ; against this system's own SM/REM and
                      (    forth6809.asm):06845                                      ; FM/MOD: DIVCOMMON restores the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06846                                      ; remainder's sign from DNSIGN (the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06847                                      ; dividend's own original sign) after
                      (    forth6809.asm):06848                                      ; dividing absolute values - exactly
                      (    forth6809.asm):06849                                      ; SM/REM's own logic, confirmed identical
                      (    forth6809.asm):06850                                      ; by direct comparison. FM/MOD, by
                      (    forth6809.asm):06851                                      ; contrast, has an explicit flooring
                      (    forth6809.asm):06852                                      ; adjustment step (correcting the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06853                                      ; quotient and remainder when the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06854                                      ; quotient would be negative with a
                      (    forth6809.asm):06855                                      ; nonzero remainder) that DIVCOMMON does
                      (    forth6809.asm):06856                                      ; not have. This system's primary
                      (    forth6809.asm):06857                                      ; division words (/, MOD, /MOD) use
                      (    forth6809.asm):06858                                      ; symmetric division, not floored -
                      (    forth6809.asm):06859                                      ; FLOORED is 0 (false), a real, meaningful
                      (    forth6809.asm):06860                                      ; answer (recognized query, value false),
                      (    forth6809.asm):06861                                      ; not the "unrecognized" fallthrough
                      (    forth6809.asm):06862                                      ; WORDLISTS correctly uses.
